---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Missions | Providence Community Church | Church in Lenexa, KS"
  description="Learn how Providence Community Church engages in global missions through Sovereign Grace Churches and our partnership in the Philippines."
  path="/missions/"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Missions</p>
      <h1>To the ends of the earth.</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.15rem;">Providence exists to display truth and beauty in community &mdash; and to carry the good news of Jesus Christ well beyond Lenexa.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule section-panel">
    <div class="wrap grid-2">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our primary vehicle</p>
        <h2>Sovereign Grace Missions</h2>
        <p>Sovereign Grace Churches exists to plant and strengthen churches for the glory of God. As a Sovereign Grace church, our primary vehicle for missions is SGC Missions &mdash; planting churches, strengthening pastors in emerging nations, and sending long-term and short-term missionaries around the world.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="https://sgcmissions.com" style="margin-top:8px;">Explore SGC Missions</a>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex; justify-content:center;">
        <img src="/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/SGC-1024x343.png" alt="Sovereign Grace Churches" loading="lazy" style="max-width:300px;" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">A field close to our hearts</p>
      <h2>The Philippines</h2>
      <p>One of our main mission fields is the Philippines, where pastors are hungry for sound theological training. Through Sovereign Grace's partnership with Training Leaders International, sixteen emerging pastors from across the Philippine islands are receiving nine courses of formal theological training over three years &mdash; beginning with &ldquo;Knowing God, Scripture, and Ourselves&rdquo; &mdash; while new churches are planted in Cebu and beyond.</p>
      <p>We also partner with <a href="https://sendjosh.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Josh Montague</a>, a Training Strategist with Training Leaders International, who travels to equip pastors in the Philippines and beyond.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule section-panel">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Pakistan</p>
      <h2>Our oldest missions partnership.</h2>
      <p>For more than a decade, Providence has led this work &mdash; partnering with Sovereign Grace and Training Leaders International to train ten Pakistani pastors in biblical interpretation and expository preaching, gathering in Dubai and Amman. With that curriculum now complete, six of those pastors meet monthly to pursue ordination in Sovereign Grace Churches.</p>
      <p>The fruit has multiplied far beyond ten men: hundreds of Pakistani believers are now studying biblical books like Genesis, Mark, Psalms, Ephesians, Isaiah, and Revelation &mdash; trainees passing on what they received, following Paul's pattern in 2 Timothy 2:2.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:680px; text-align:center;">
      <h2 class="caps-head">Pray. Go. Give.</h2>
      <p>Want to get involved in what God is doing among the nations? We'd love to talk.</p>
      <a class="btn-dark" href="mailto:chris@sovgracekc.org?subject=Missions">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
